msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/wtranslator/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wtranslator.php
msgid "Professional website translation plugin powered by Google Translate. Fully functional standalone; no external API required."
msgstr "Plugin profesional de tradución de sitios web con tecnoloxía de Google Translate. Totalmente funcional e independente; non require API externa."

